<h1>Modify</h1>
<hr align="left" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from the</span> <i style="font-style:normal; font-weight:bold;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>tree context menu for Transformation &gt; Modify</b></span></i><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
<p class="Description"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB" class="Command">Modify</span> <span lang="EN-GB">command translates and rotates a transformation. The actual behaviour is changing the transformation matrix.</span></p>
<p><img src="Images/modify.gif" width="321px" height="229px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Create copy</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB">Check this option to generate transformation with the modified location and/or orientation. If unchecked the co-ordinate system to which the command is applied, is translated and/or rotated.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Translate</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB">Check this option to translate the transformation.</span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-P-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>X</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– offset along transformations’ X-axis. For example, if the transformation is translated with +10mm along X-axis, the X co-ordinates of all entities, which it is applied to, will be increased by 10mm.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-P-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Y</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– offset along transformations’ Y-axis.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-P-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Z</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– offset along transformations’ Z-axis.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Rotate</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB">Check this option to rotate the transformation.</span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>X</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– angle around transformations’ X-axis. For example, if the transformation is rotated by +10 degrees around X-axis, all entities, which it is applied to, will be rotated by +10 degrees around X-axis.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Y</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– angle around transformations’ Y-axis.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Z</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– angle around transformations’ Z-axis.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Note" id="p1"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">: The translation and rotation are performed according to the axes of the transformation, not to the global ones.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Related topic</b></span>: <a href="Modify_Current_CS.htm">Modify (Current CS)</a></p>
